  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>网易严选香氛</strong></span></h1><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">网易严选是国内知名生活方式品牌，入驻比亚迪生态开放平台后，双方联合推出“四季流年”车机</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\"><strong>主题与车载除味香氛组合商品</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">。用户双击车机屏幕，即可切换四季风光，搭配车载香氛，实现</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\"><strong>视觉与嗅觉的双重感官联动</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">，营造沉浸式座舱体验。首月上线，该组合商品销量即跃升至平台</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\"><strong>车载香氛品类TOP1</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">。此次跨品类合作，成功拓宽了主题内容的消费场景。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/7953077987d54da893df465e916ad5a3.jpg?auth_key=1795677431-cf28ec6adf0949ac984cea53a6dfc175-0-a96ca57a6c9fd4e6a1f9ed0954c67f90c894f2b97382f65a4afdcf3df8b5b9f5\" alt=\"容器 5 (1).jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-1 &nbsp;网易严选香氛</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">宣发示例</span></p>"
